  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_01",
      "hash64": "D8FBAE79A04927D5",
      "text": "Oh, hallo! Wie schön, dass du im Sanitätsraum\\nvorbeischaust.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_02",
      "hash64": "D8FBAB79A04922BC",
      "text": "Nanu? Du wirkst ein bisschen stärker als beim\\nletzten Mal, kann das sein?[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_03a",
      "hash64": "FCCA20AB5C4843CA",
      "text": "Haha! Du hast ein gesundes Selbstbewusstsein...\\nAber man sieht es dir auch wirklich an.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_03b",
      "hash64": "FCCA1FAB5C484217",
      "text": "Was? Doch, du hast dich schon ein wenig\\nverändert, finde ich.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_04",
      "hash64": "D8FBA979A0491F56",
      "text": "Bestimmt hast du das den ganzen Erfahrungen\\nauf deiner Schatzsuche zu verdanken.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_05",
      "hash64": "D8FBAA79A0492109",
      "text": "Na komm, erzähl mir doch ein bisschen was von\\ndeinen Abenteuern![VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_06",
      "hash64": "D8FBA779A0491BF0",
      "text": "Wow, das ist ja echt abgefahren...[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_07",
      "hash64": "D8FBA879A0491DA3",
      "text": "Hach, noch mal Kind müsste man sein... Täglich\\nwarten neue Herausforderungen auf einen.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_08",
      "hash64": "D8FBB579A04933BA",
      "text": "Ich dagegen...[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_09",
      "hash64": "D8FBB679A049356D",
      "text": "Es war immer mein Traum, Lehrerin zu werden,\\nmusst du wissen.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_10",
      "hash64": "D8FF3379A04C3FAB",
      "text": "An die Akademie hab ich’s zwar auch geschafft,\\naber als Krankenschwester. Unterrichten darf ich\\r\\nleider nicht.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_11",
      "hash64": "D8FF3279A04C3DF8",
      "text": "Ich bin leider durch die Zulassungsprüfung für\\nGesundheitslehre gerasselt...[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_12",
      "hash64": "D8FF3579A04C4311",
      "text": "Und zwar nicht nur ein Mal. Ich weiß schon gar\\nnicht mehr, wie oft ich’s versucht habe.\\r\\nTja, und jetzt versauere ich hier im Sanitätsraum...[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_13",
      "hash64": "D8FF3479A04C415E",
      "text": "Oh, entschuldige... Ich wollte dir nicht die Ohren\\nvollheulen.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_14",
      "hash64": "D8FF3779A04C4677",
      "text": "Aber du bist [VAR 0x1100(00FF,1816,0000)]ein echt guter Zuhörereine echt gute Zuhörerin.\\nDa plappert man eben einfach drauf los.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1816",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_15",
      "hash64": "D8FF3679A04C44C4",
      "text": "Ich hoffe, ich hab dich nicht total vergrault mit\\nmeinem Gerede. Komm gerne wieder vorbei![VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_system_01",
      "hash64": "48F26716F9FD767F",
      "text": "Du hast dich noch ein bisschen mehr mit\\nSeñora Mimi angefreundet!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
